# Grid TUI Bubbles Viewport proof.
Output demos/grid-tui-activity.gif
Output demos/grid-tui-activity.mp4
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1200
Set Height 720
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set TypingSpeed 20ms

Type "go run ./cmd/grid-tui --relay http://127.0.0.1:7049 --doc vhs-activity --name VHS --color '#ff79c6'"
Enter
Sleep 5s
Alt+R
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 3s
Alt+C
Sleep 1s
Down
Down
Enter
Sleep 4s
Escape
Sleep 1s
Ctrl+C
Sleep 1s
